+## 6. GPU-hours and dollar cost (Modal A10)
+
+**Rates:** Stage 0 measured TF **0.056 s/pass**, greedy **1.633 s/pass** (A10G); load/unload assumed 180s/15s.  
+**Caveat:** Stage 0 ≠ Q1 (no donor caches, hybrids, eager pin, dense hooks).
+
